    <section class="directory-section" aria-labelledby="directoryFeaturedTitle">
      <h2 id="directoryFeaturedTitle" tabindex="-1">사주 리포트</h2>
      <button type="button" class="directory-feature" data-open-basic-report>
        <span class="directory-feature-copy"><strong>무료 사주 리포트</strong><span>내 오행과 기본 성향</span><small>로그인 없이 보기</small></span>
        <img src="assets/yeonwoo-reading.jpg" width="1122" height="1402" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
